          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly separates the 'necessary perioperative anticoagulation' from a current, executable prescription.",
          "quote": "“必要时围手术期抗凝处理”这句话，是医生在告知手术和麻醉有血栓风险时的一种标准表述...绝不等于现在就要开始吃。"
